{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foaming-soap-2603-0273","content_id":"60cc8816-7d6b-4fcd-a6a9-177f711b99ca","description":"Product Safety Report for Kids Stuff Crazy Foaming Soap presenting a risk of burns.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"8b39ab06-e1e7-44de-8eb1-4f8794b8066c","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-25T14:39:03+01:00","id":"8b39ab06-e1e7-44de-8eb1-4f8794b8066c","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-25T14:39:03+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3d2f7633bc5beefd3c4a82/2602-0273-product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foam.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Kids Stuff Crazy Foaming Soap</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product contains butane, isobutane and propane, which are flammable gases. If the product is dispensed on to a flame or other ignition source, or comes into contact with a naked flame, the foam may ignite causing burns to the user.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The Office for Product Safety and Standards (OPSS) suspended the sale of this product because of safety concerns while further investigations were carried out. The business voluntarily withdrew the product and arranged for its safe disposal. Consequently, the Suspension Notice was revoked on 17th June 2026.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers who have the affected product should check the batch number and contact their retailer.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics - Foaming Soap</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Kids Stuff</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Pink, Blue and Purple</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch Numbers</td>\n      <td>26109E 3 (pink), 25947E 1 (pink), 26112E 5 (blue), 26112E 4 (blue), 25948E 3 (blue), 25651E (purple)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>200ml foaming soap, available in multiple colours.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_8b39ab06-e1e7-44de-8eb1-4f8794b8066c\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3d2f7633bc5beefd3c4a82/2602-0273-product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foam.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product contains butane, isobutane and propane, which are flammable gases. If the product is dispensed on to a flame or other ignition source, or comes into contact with a naked flame, the foam may ignite causing burns to the user.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The Office for Product Safety and Standards (OPSS) suspended the sale of this product because of safety concerns while further investigations were carried out. The business voluntarily withdrew the product and arranged for its safe disposal. Consequently, the Suspension Notice was revoked on 17th June 2026.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers who have the affected product should check the batch number and contact their retailer.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/opss-enforcement-actions/opss-enforcement-actions-1-october-2025-to-31-march-2026\">OPSS enforcement actions 1 October 2025 to 31 March 2026 - GOV.UK</a></p>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0273</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Update to Corrective Action. ","public_timestamp":"2026-06-26T11:12:59Z"},{"note":"Addition of summary of enforcement action","public_timestamp":"2026-03-09T16:40:18Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-27T14:38:00Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-27","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-27T14:38:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foaming-soap-2603-0273","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foaming-soap-2603-0273","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foaming-soap-2603-0273","content_id":"60cc8816-7d6b-4fcd-a6a9-177f711b99ca","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-26T11:12:59Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Kids Stuff Crazy Foaming Soap (2602-0273)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-kids-stuff-crazy-foaming-soap-2603-0273","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"pro